        </p>

    </footer>

<!-- HOW IT WORKS SECTION -->
<section class="how-it-works">

    <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="section-label">ELECTION PROCESS</p>
        <h2>How the Election Works</h2>
        <p>
            A simple and transparent process that makes college elections
            easier for students, candidates and administrators.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="process-container">

        <div class="process-card">
            <div class="process-number">01</div>
            <h3>Student Login</h3>
            <p>
                Students securely log in using their registered credentials
                to access the election portal.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="process-card">
            <div class="process-number">02</div>
            <h3>View Candidates</h3>
            <p>
                Students can view candidate profiles, positions and
                election information before voting.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="process-card">
            <div class="process-number">03</div>
            <h3>Cast Your Vote</h3>
            <p>
                Students select their preferred candidate and securely
                submit their vote.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="process-card">
            <div class="process-number">04</div>
            <h3>View Results</h3>
            <p>
                After the election, authorized administrators can view
                organized voting results and statistics.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>

</section>

</body>

</html>
